{"message":"feat(tactics): transport heterogeneous equality and retain dependent field proofs\n\nUse admitted HEq bridges to substitute endpoint types before values.\nPreserve proof-dependent hypotheses, local lets and branch identities.\nConnect HEq reflexivity, injection and compact contradiction proofs.\n\nA recursor-derived continuation retains every constructor field when\nselectors are incomplete; proof-family data extraction remains forbidden.\nRestore temporary contexts on failed construction. No new axiom or\nadmission authority. Full five-package, Clippy and workspace checks run\nbefore non-forced publication. Related workstreams: fln-kpd, fln-qb5.","sha256":"56595c1978661d1860b831764a867ede21f5eaa5baf3cf90ca4bad0894b3849b","length":65981,"parts":["0061b8416ce5f9533ef6a109478316133e6de1ed","8c903ce68cc703201a12c7552d6ea575c9badd1c","cbf928e5187063deb4c71d4227495622ebea7e83","9be2fde2839e5820b241ff10bd95aa4994e2ed07","72954c783a2803a03c7409301c7dcdc961348806"],"base_blobs":{"crates/fln-cli/tests/source_check.rs":"601e37afea9cd0a5bb4cc2389f3343727a67e3ae","crates/fln-elab/src/source/tactics.rs":"4514b8afc375f84651e52e21b7430700422c3e44","crates/fln-elab/src/source/tactics/constructor_transport.rs":null,"crates/fln-elab/src/source/tactics/constructors.rs":"dae0f22ecfbb768d9991cd707e6d30dbf786fa9b","crates/fln-elab/src/source/tactics/equality.rs":"8491f1e883f3734354f6bf8306ebe9153f1edba3","crates/fln/tests/source_equality_reasoning.rs":"e7cecba568f2b85606bd75b6217c6460df2e3747","docs/NATIVE_CONSTRUCTOR_EQUALITY.md":"66b19cf4d6651bb245a333ed404a3464f35a086c","docs/NATIVE_DEPENDENT_INJECTION.md":null,"examples/native_constructor_equalities.lean":null,"examples/native_heterogeneous_equality.lean":null},"source_sha256":{"crates/fln-cli/tests/source_check.rs":"33e8c6aa654dce6cff07523a3aa57f9f55cf78e9968329bbaeeaaf1618bf7cbc","crates/fln-elab/src/source/tactics.rs":"8d8484ed9700251ae5db289fe5b311afa2d268feafb8aa4b6d0aa1cf0f687a3b","crates/fln-elab/src/source/tactics